    "sections": {
        "description": "Aurora Lite gives you complete control over every section of your blog, header, homepage, archives, posts, and 404, all from the live Customizer, with no code required. It is a flexible WordPress blog theme built for bloggers, publishers, and content-driven websites. Supports custom colors, Google Fonts, RTL languages, Ajax load more, masonry archives, sidebar control, and WooCommerce. Upgrade to Aurora Pro for 53 layout templates, custom content sections, vertical headers, contact details in header and footer, author social fields, custom JavaScript fields, and 5000+ possible design combinations."
    },
